---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="Why this helpful public correction service exists." current="about">
  <article class="prose-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">About this site</p>
    <h1>Correctness, delivered politely.</h1>
    <p class="lede">This site exists for those moments when a product name, spelling or bit of terminology is almost right—but almost is doing a lot of work.</p>
    <h2>How to use it</h2>
    <p>Find the correct term in the directory, copy its direct link, and share it with the person who needs a small and helpful nudge. Every correction preserves the exact capitalisation and spacing of its common incorrect versions, because that difference is often the entire point.</p>
    <h2>Something missing?</h2>
    <p>The old suggestion form has retired. You can now <a href="https://github.com/loryanstrant/LetMeCorrectThatForYou/issues/new?template=suggest-a-correction.yml">suggest a correction on GitHub</a>, or submit a pull request if you already know your way around the project.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
